computed the way the matcher's scripts/vectors_digest.sh computes it: the
sha256 of the `sha256sum` manifest of every *.json under the four directories,
LC_ALL=C sorted, paths relative to this directory, README.md excluded. Counts
at that commit: zkp_req 54, zkp_req_response 143, zkp_req_unsat 43,
